[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7443.03, "timestamp": "02:04:03", "text": "把它放在旁边某个地方就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7446.79, "timestamp": "02:04:06", "text": "确保它清晰可见。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7451.669, "timestamp": "02:04:11", "text": "调试"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7455.35, "timestamp": "02:04:15", "text": "OBS 为场景增添了色彩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7460.31, "timestamp": "02:04:20", "text": "将 URL 更改为此调试信息，然后确定。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7462.79, "timestamp": "02:04:22", "text": "好了，现在屏幕上显示了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7465.83, "timestamp": "02:04:25", "text": "点击互动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7477.43, "timestamp": "02:04:37", "text": "右键单击并选择“是”。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7479.99, "timestamp": "02:04:39", "text": "呃，你看，顶部是重新启动的标志。有一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7482.07, "timestamp": "02:04:42", "text": "重启一下，对吧？点击重新启动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7484.07, "timestamp": "02:04:44", "text": "是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7487.43, "timestamp": "02:04:47", "text": "重启后没有任何反应。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7489.51, "timestamp": "02:04:49", "text": "呃，你点了吗？你点击了吗？呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7493.35, "timestamp": "02:04:53", "text": "互动和小橱窗购物？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7494.95, "timestamp": "02:04:54", "text": "好的。出事了。我不认为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7497.669, "timestamp": "02:04:57", "text": "我觉得我犯了个错误，比如"}]